{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the demo, only the rhythm and sparring modes of the first robot are available; the other robots are locked. In rhythm mode, only amateur and semi-pro levels are accessible. In sparring mode, only the normal level is available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crush robots in a gym of gears and vapor! Fight freely in Sparring Mode or punch to the beat in Rhythm Mode to claim the throne!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two Modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rhythm Mode: Sync your punches and blocks to the beat of pulsing music, timing your strikes and defenses to the rhythm for a fluid, high-energy fight against robotic boxers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sparring Mode: Engage in free-flowing combat in the ring, battling robotic rivals with unrestricted punches, dodges, and combos to overpower your mechanical foes.</p></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3770070?t=1748682805","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770070/a1df7c1978c6b6b37a76910bba07ca077884dc8a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748682805","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770070/ed828fa20e0952d92ae8bd38679c3c4d4ee952d8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748682805","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770070/ed828fa20e0952d92ae8bd38679c3c4d4ee952d8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748682805","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"VR Only","id":54}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the demo, only the rhythm and sparring modes of the first robot are available; the other robots are locked. In rhythm mode, only amateur and semi-pro levels are accessible. In sparring mode, only the normal level is available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crush robots in a gym of gears and vapor! Fight freely in Sparring Mode or punch to the beat in Rhythm Mode to claim the throne!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two Modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rhythm Mode: Sync your punches and blocks to the beat of pulsing music, timing your strikes and defenses to the rhythm for a fluid, high-energy fight against robotic boxers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sparring Mode: Engage in free-flowing combat in the ring, battling robotic rivals with unrestricted punches, dodges, and combos to overpower your mechanical foes.</p></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>","developers":["Vnow Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3678800","name":"Boxing Machine VR"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770070/203f3806a9a95f2d241f83378e2293864566d6f2/header.jpg?t=1748682805","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257144640,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257144640/movie480.mp4?t=1748536503","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257144640/movie_max.mp4?t=1748536503"},"name":"BM trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257144640/2d9759a9e993fb79b1c3d8bfd088b00795f27ba7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748536503","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257144640/